      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Skipping or missing never counts as \"missed\" or worse (SP-02).\nNote, emotion and context apply in every mode.\nEmotionChoice: the feeling only, or a word that\nalready carries its CoreFeeling (the word is optional).\nThe engine only receives DailyOutcomes and DailyFactors:\nnotes, emotions and personalTags never enter (SP-20).\nA day without a FactorLog is left out of the comparison;\nan empty FactorLog (\"nada hoje\") counts as \"without\".",
